  "description": "Silk.NET/SDL + wgpu-native backend for WACS.WASI.GFX. Implements IBackend for wasi:graphics-context, wasi:surface, wasi:frame-buffer, and wasi:webgpu on top of SDL2 + wgpu-native via Silk.NET. Ships as a sibling NuGet so consumers wiring a different backend don't pull SDL's or wgpu-native's binaries. Preview: tracks the wasi-gfx proposal at WASI Phase 2 — the WIT surface may change as the proposal evolves.",
